### DELETE konfigurierter Wahltag EUW
DELETE {{ WLS_INFOMANAGEMENT_SERVICE_URL }}/businessActions/konfigurierterWahltag/EUW
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("auth-service")}}

### check is aktive
GET {{ WLS_INFOMANAGEMENT_SERVICE_URL }}/businessActions/loginCheck/EUW